OL,3,AFake 10 Downing Street listing exposes
OL,4,A'unfit' Booking.com, says consumer
OL,5,Agroup
OL,6,
OL,7,F"This limited test is not a true
OL,8,Freflection of the experience of
OL,9,Fmillions of listings or reviews
OL,10,Fpublished on our platform," a
OL,11,FBooking.com spokesperson told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
