OL,3,AGary Glitter pleads not guilty to
OL,4,Ahistorical sex offence charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FGary Glitter, the former singer whose
OL,7,Freal name is Paul Gadd, has pleaded not
OL,8,Fguilty to eight allegations of sexual
OL,9,Fabuse against a girl when she was aged
OL,10,Fbetween eight and 11.
OL,12,FGadd, 82, is accused of offences
OL,13,Fagainst the girl between 1978 and 1981,
OL,14,Fafter allegedly giving her chocolate
OL,15,Fand inviting her to his home in
OL,16,FKensington and Chelsea, west London.
OL,18,FIt is alleged he caused the girl to
OL,19,Ftouch his genitals and "engaged in
OL,20,Funlawful sexual intercourse" with her.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
