OL,3,AGary Glitter pleads not guilty to
OL,4,Ahistorical sex offence charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Southwark Crown Court on Wednesday,
OL,7,FGlitter appeared via video-link from
OL,8,Fprison to enter his pleas.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
